[SPEAKER_02]: definitely am taking notes and making it happen. This seems like a beautiful way to give back something to the sponsor and also have

26:28.120 --> 26:36.704
[SPEAKER_02]: something for yourself and make your dreams a reality while maintaining a fine balance. Love it. It's worth saying, happy to hear

